cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ForeAct
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying ForeAct paper and this
  repository.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Jiaxi
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Yunheng
abstract: >-
  ForeAct is a geometry-aware vision-language-action policy that uses a
  pretrained video world model for single-pass visual representation learning
  and next-frame relative-depth supervision for future-geometry learning.
keywords:
  - vision-language-action
  - robot-learning
  - world-models
  - future-geometry
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-10-06'
